      "text": "Any service reaches OpenFGA the same way it reaches another internal service.\nNot a distinct topology — it's option 1, described from the caller's side.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Any service reaches OpenFGA the same way it reaches another internal service.\nNot a distinct topology — it's option 1, described from the caller's side.",
